              <span class="vs-gallery-card-badge">Commercial Grade</span>
              <img src="{{ 'solar-lights.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="All-in-One Solar Street Light" class="vs-gallery-img" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600">
            </div>
            <div class="vs-gallery-body">
              <h2 class="vs-gallery-title">All-in-One Solar Street Light</h2>
              <p class="vs-gallery-desc">Integrated solar luminaire with monocrystalline PV panel, LiFePO4 battery storage, and dusk-to-dawn radar sensor.</p>
              <div class="vs-card-variant-row">
                <select class="vs-card-variant-select" data-variant-select aria-label="Select variant">
                  <option value="sl-30w" data-price="3999" selected>30W Standard Street Light — ₹3,999</option>
                  <option value="sl-15w" data-price="2499">15W Compact Luminaire — ₹2,499</option>
